#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-giga-r1-wifi.rst:785
msgid ""
"**TIM1** is reserved for the **camera master clock** when the camera is "
"initialised through :doc:`/library/omv.csi`. Pins whose only PWM function is"
" on TIM1 — ``D1``, ``D10``, ``D11``, ``D12`` — cannot be PWM‑driven while "
"the camera is active. The other listed pins all have non‑TIM1 alternates."
